Phase 7 — Investigator

In: Allowlisted read tools, audit log, deterministic template if no LLM.
Out: Any tool that mutates transactions.state.
Done when: a case file exists and approve_payment is impossible.

Implementation: Investigator invokes only get_transaction, get_features,
verify_intent, and create_investigation. POST /v1/investigations writes a
deterministic case file and append-only investigator_audit rows. Approve and
decline tools are denied. MANUAL_REVIEW cases escalate to a human. Authorize
does not depend on the investigator.
